  - Upstream license: `LICENSE.upstream`

- `quirc/`
  - Source: https://github.com/dlbeer/quirc
  - Upstream docs: `quirc/README.upstream.md`
  - Upstream license: `quirc/LICENSE.upstream`

- `openmv/collections.c`
- `openmv/collections.h`
- `openmv/fmath.h`
  - Source: https://github.com/openmv/openmv
